1
00:00:02,510 --> 00:00:04,740
真想知道曼尼现在在做什么
I wonder what Manny's doing right now.

2
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:06,411
你给他打个电话吧
Why don't you call him?

3
00:00:06,490 --> 00:00:08,080
你打啊 我又不在乎他在做什么
You call him. I don't care what he's doing.

4
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:09,340
我在尽量不烦他
I'm trying not to bug him.

5
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:12,320
他说他需要一些时间来适应大学
He said that he needed some time to adjust to college,

6
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:13,204
所以我在给他
so I'm giving him --

7
00:00:13,204 --> 00:00:13,979
停车
Stop the car!

8
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:17,380
你为什么要这样
Why would you do that?!

9
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:18,300
那好像是小短
I think that's Shorty.

10
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:21,960
从我开始记事
Shorty and I have been best friends

11
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,020
小短就是我最好的朋友
for as long as I can remember.

12
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:25,920
他和他老婆达琳几年前
He and his wife, Darlene, moved to Costa Rica

13
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,320
搬去了哥斯达黎加 原因是...
a few years back for, uh --

14
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:28,960
我也不知道
I don't know why.

15
00:00:29,116 --> 00:00:31,760
他想毁掉自己生活吧 吃吃豆子 抵抗疟疾
Ruin his life eating beans, fighting malaria,

16
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:33,840
喝人们的洗澡水啊
drinking water people bathe in?

17
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:34,700
这种时候
This.

18
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:37,200
你这种时候就听起来像有种族歧视
This is when you sound racist!

19
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:40,180
你回来都不告诉我的吗
You come to town and you don't tell me?

20
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:41,480
看老子不掐死你
I ought to punch you in the neck,

21
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:42,400
你这个王八蛋
you son of a bitch.

22
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,139
杰
Jay!

23
00:00:43,139 --> 00:00:44,559
我要踢你的膝盖
I want to kick you in the knee,

24
00:00:44,559 --> 00:00:45,855
你这个蠢蛋
you stupid idiot!

25
00:00:45,855 --> 00:00:46,920
没这种说法
That might not be a thing.

26
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:48,640
你是个很垃圾的最好的朋友
You're a terrible best friend.

27
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:50,880
别冲我吼 我才回来几天
Don't yell at me. I'm only here a couple of days.

28
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:52,760
临时决定回来 本来打算告诉你的
It was last-minute. I was gonna call.

29
00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:55,140
这是乔吗
This Joe?

30
00:00:55,140 --> 00:00:56,240
你真大
You're huge.

31
00:00:56,530 --> 00:00:58,105
我还能长更大
Eh, I can be bigger.

32
00:00:58,140 --> 00:00:59,480
你干什么呢 住哪里
What are you doing? Where are you staying?

33
00:01:00,003 --> 00:01:01,460
我住那边的酒店
I'm checking in at the hotel over there.

34
00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:02,100
不能住酒店
No hotels.

35
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:04,420
你乱花钱 就跟乱穿裤子一样
You're as bad with money as you are with pants.

36
00:01:04,420 --> 00:01:05,840
你穿的这是什么鬼
What's going on down there, anyway?

37
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:06,080
这裤子吗
These?

38
00:01:07,047 --> 00:01:08,440
松身裤
Palazzos.

39
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:09,760
从未感觉如此舒适
Never felt so comfortable.

40
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,720
随心所欲 毫无阻碍
Everything goes where it wants to go.

41
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:15,080
小短 不如你来住我们家吧
Shorty, why don't you come and stay with us?

42
00:01:15,340 --> 00:01:16,500
你还能有自己的房间呢
You will even get your own room

43
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:18,080
因为曼尼去上大学了
'cause Manny's off to college.

44
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:19,910
上大学 他怎么样了
College?! How's he doing?

45
00:01:19,910 --> 00:01:22,780
真希望我知道 他需要一些空间
I wish I knew. He needed some space.

46
00:01:22,780 --> 00:01:23,400
在此期间
In the meantime,

47
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:25,660
她给他寄了个菲亚特汽车大小的爱心包裹
she sends him a care package the size of a Fiat,

48
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:27,874
里面还装着一包我最爱的香肠
which included a pack of my favorite sausage.

49
00:01:27,874 --> 00:01:28,760
我没把香肠放...
I did not put the sausage --

50
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:30,780
不然香肠去哪儿了 我吃没吃我心里有数
Well, where did it go, then?! I know what I ate!

51
00:01:30,780 --> 00:01:32,640
我现在有太多烦心事了
There's too many things upsetting me right now.

52
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:33,500
快去拿你的行李
Go get your stuff.

53
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:35,040
来我们家碰头 说定了
Meet us back at the house. It's done.

54
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:36,318
-没问题 -真棒
- You got it! ?- Yes!

55
00:01:36,318 --> 00:01:38,400
曼尼走了后 家里终于
It's gonna be so nice since Manny's gone

56
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:40,360
又有个有趣的人 真是太好了
to have somebody fun again in the house.

57
00:01:55,860 --> 00:01:57,820
你准备好了吗 大哥哥
Are you ready for this, big boy?

58
00:01:58,180 --> 00:01:58,920
我准备好了
Oh, I'm ready.

59
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:01,640
场面会很"凌乱"的
And it's gonna get pretty messy.

60
00:02:02,370 --> 00:02:05,440
你想要当蓝色还是金色
So, do you want to be blue or gold?

61
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:06,420
当蓝色
I'll be blue.

62
00:02:06,759 --> 00:02:07,868
因为我很酷...
'Cause I'm cool --

63
00:02:08,440 --> 00:02:09,140
好痒
Aah! That tickles!

64
00:02:09,140 --> 00:02:11,560
克莱尔最近去了个单身女郎派对
Claire recently went to a bachelorette party

65
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:14,440
他们送了每个人激情绘画工具
where they gave everyone a passion painting kit.

66
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:16,245
这个就是让你和你伴侣
The idea is that you and your partner

67
00:02:16,245 --> 00:02:17,478
将身上涂满颜料
cover one another in paint --

68
00:02:17,860 --> 00:02:19,520
趴在画布上
get down on the canvas.

69
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:23,180
然后"好好作画"
And then get down on the canvas.

70
00:02:24,650 --> 00:02:26,120
别扭来扭去了 菲尔
?Stop squirming, Phil.

71
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,280
我都没法给你涂颜料了
I'm never gonna get this paint on you.

72
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,240
好吧 我给你涂
Okay, I'll do you.

73
00:02:28,269 --> 00:02:30,789
把你变成金色 就像奥斯卡小金人
You're gonna be so gold, you'll like an Oscar.

74
00:02:31,089 --> 00:02:33,640
-有好多人要感谢呢 -是啊
- So many people to thank. ?- Oh, yeah.

75
00:02:35,980 --> 00:02:37,420
糟糕 是艾丽克斯
Oh, crap, it's Alex.

76
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:38,218
别接啊
Just ignore it.

77
00:02:38,218 --> 00:02:40,257
不行 万一是出了什么事怎么办
I can't. What if something's wrong?

78
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:43,000
亲爱的 一切还好吗
Hi, honey. Everything okay?

79
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,383
是啊 我只是想告诉你
Yeah, I'm just, uh, letting you know

80
00:02:44,383 --> 00:02:45,617
今晚我会回家睡
I'm sleeping at home tonight.

81
00:02:46,247 --> 00:02:47,400
你还有多久到
Uh, h-how far away are you?

82
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,800
大概二十分钟
About 20 minutes.

83
00:02:49,288 --> 00:02:50,809
那我们有十分钟的时间清理
Oh, that leaves 10 minutes for cleanup.

84
00:02:51,017 --> 00:02:53,715
还有 本今晚可以住家里吗
Also, is it okay if, um, Ben stays over tonight?

85
00:02:54,140 --> 00:02:56,620
行啊 他妈咪同意就行
Sure. I guess if his mommy says it's okay.

86
00:02:56,620 --> 00:02:58,320
妈 你没必要每次本来我们家
Mom, you don't have to take a shot at Ben

87
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:59,620
都要嘲笑他一次吧
every time he comes up.

88
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:01,680
就是嘛 我怎么可能没先问过我妈同意
Yeah, right, like I wouldn't ask my mom.

89
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,390
我真的该装作没听见吗
I'm really supposed to ignore that?

90
00:03:03,390 --> 00:03:04,000
听着 他是我男朋友
Listen, he is my boyfriend,

91
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,147
-我真的要受够了 -冷静点
- and I'm getting really tired of this. - Oh, calm down.

92
00:03:07,147 --> 00:03:08,260
-只是开玩笑啊 -一点都不好笑
- It was just a joke. - Well, it's not funny!

93
00:03:08,260 --> 00:03:10,946
你攻击本 就等于攻击我
When you attack Ben, you attack me.

94
00:03:10,946 --> 00:03:11,995
好了好了 我知道了
Yeah, yeah, I got it.

95
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,899
我们进行到哪儿了
Now, where were we?

96
00:03:14,899 --> 00:03:17,401
亲爱的 我好像没感觉了现在
Honey, I kind of think maybe the moment has passed.

97
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:20,440
是我爸 又怎么了
Ohh, it's my dad. What now?

98
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:21,520
别接啊
Just ignore it.

99
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:23,180
不行 万一是出了什么事怎么办
I can't. What if something's wrong?

100
00:03:24,069 --> 00:03:25,443
-亲爱的 -嗨 老爸
- Hey, honey. - ?Hi, Dad.

101
00:03:25,443 --> 00:03:26,760
小短来了
Shorty's in town!

102
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:28,820
我要我送给菲尔的那套高尔夫球杆
I need that set of golf clubs I gave to Phil.

103
00:03:28,820 --> 00:03:31,220
反正给那笨蛋也只是浪费那套杆子
That bonehead's certainly not putting them to any good use.

104
00:03:31,220 --> 00:03:33,440
为什么 老爸 你为什么老攻击他
Why, Dad? Why do you always have to attack him?

105
00:03:33,580 --> 00:03:35,300
冷静点 只是开个玩笑啊
Oh, calm down. It was just a joke.

106
00:03:35,300 --> 00:03:36,580
我明早来取
I'll pick them up in the morning.

107
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:39,160
我会被他气死
He pisses me off so much!

108
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,380
来吧 接着玩
Come on! Let's do this!

109
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:43,106
感觉你玩的目的不是因为我了
This doesn't feel like it's about me.

110
00:03:43,106 --> 00:03:46,620
我要去冲个澡
I'm gonna hop in the shower.

111
00:03:46,620 --> 00:03:47,060
什么
What?

112
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,260
你最近怎么了
What's been going on with you lately?

113
00:03:49,260 --> 00:03:50,380
看起来很帅哦
You look so handsome.

114
00:03:50,380 --> 00:03:51,500
谢谢 亲爱的
Oh, well, thank you, sweetie.

115
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:52,179
你知道吗
You know what,

116
00:03:52,179 --> 00:03:54,934
我的护肤流程又多了一项精华
I added a serum step to my skin-care regimen.

117
00:03:54,974 --> 00:03:56,068
等等
W-Wait a minute.

118
00:03:56,068 --> 00:03:57,820
你就是想拐我们让你去上骑马课
You're just angling for horseback-riding lessons,

119
00:03:57,820 --> 00:03:58,380
对不对
aren't you?

120
00:03:58,380 --> 00:03:59,482
-拜托 -不行
Come on! ?No.

121
00:03:59,482 --> 00:04:01,224
不能让你变成那种日程满满当当的小孩
You're not gonna become one of those over-scheduled kids

122
00:04:01,224 --> 00:04:02,520
13岁就过度劳累
that burns out at 13

123
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,300
还穿军靴去沙滩
and wears combat boots to the beach.

124
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:06,200
我是我们学校里最闲的亚洲小孩了
I'm the least-busy Asian kid in my school.

125
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:07,980
很好 拉住床单另一头
Great. Take the other end of this sheet

126
00:04:07,980 --> 00:04:09,660
帮我给莱昂内尔铺床
and help me make up the bed for Lionel.

127
00:04:09,660 --> 00:04:10,900
莱昂内尔今晚要住这里吗
Lionel's staying here tonight?

128
00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:13,180
对 胡娇和罗纳多会送他过来
Yes. ?Yes. Pepper and Ronaldo are dropping him off.

129
00:04:13,180 --> 00:04:15,000
去年 胡娇和罗纳多告诉我们
Last year, Pepper and Ronaldo told us

130
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,300
他们想为人父母
that they wanted to become parents

131
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:18,360
而且正在努力搞到蕾哈娜的卵子
and were on a quest to acquire Rihanna's eggs.

132
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:20,500
我们说 "你们这俩富婆
And we said, "Or, you rich queens,

133
00:04:20,500 --> 00:04:22,560
也可以给需要家庭的孩子一个家啊"
you could provide a home for a child that needs one."

134
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,460
所以他们领养了一个
So they adopted,

135
00:04:23,460 --> 00:04:25,460
我们有点担心事情发展的情况
and we are a little nervous about how it's going

136
00:04:25,460 --> 00:04:28,140
因为当他们头一回介绍莱昂内尔的时候
because, um, when they first introduced us to Lionel,

137
00:04:28,140 --> 00:04:30,280
我们看得出来他们不是很合
we could tell that it wasn't a great fit.

138
00:04:30,350 --> 00:04:32,508
莱昂内尔 很高兴认识你啊
Hi, Lionel, it's nice meeting you.

139
00:04:32,508 --> 00:04:34,000
衣服挺酷
Hey. ?Cool shirt.

140
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,120
是篮球变装服
It's a basketball costume.

141
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:36,880
是运动衫
Jersey.

142
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:38,860
是运动衫 对
Jersey. Right.

143
00:04:38,860 --> 00:04:39,980
就像《泽西男孩》
Like "Jersey Boys."

144
00:04:40,900 --> 00:04:42,800
好了 谁给我杯喝的吧
Okay, somebody fix me a drink.

145
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:44,780
我们刚从车窗外买了芝士汉堡
We just got cheeseburgers out of a window

146
00:04:44,780 --> 00:04:45,920
还坐在车里吃了
and ate in our car.

147
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:48,118
我们卖车时需要坦白受过这灾害吗
Do we have to disclose that when we sell it?

148
00:04:48,118 --> 00:04:50,080
虽然一开始不太顺利
It seemed like a bit of a rocky start,

149
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:51,340
但胡娇说现在还挺不错的
but Pepper said it's going well.

150
00:04:51,340 --> 00:04:52,820
看来做父母确实会改变你
Parenting does change you.

151
00:04:52,820 --> 00:04:55,001
有莉莉之前 我有时候会很戏精
You know, before Lily, I could be so dramatic.

152
00:04:55,001 --> 00:04:57,640
-而我以前总是紧张过度 -但看看我们现在
- Oh, and I used to be so uptight. - But look at us now.

153
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:59,720
-抱歉 -你的手差点儿伸到我嘴里了
- Oh, sorry. - Okay, your hand almost went in my mouth.

154
00:05:00,580 --> 00:05:01,778
快进来
Come in, come in.

155
00:05:01,778 --> 00:05:03,700
我好喜欢这个
Ohh! I like this!

156
00:05:03,700 --> 00:05:05,937
这样比以前在这里的东西好看多了
It's a lot better than what was here before.

157
00:05:05,937 --> 00:05:07,778
那里以前是我们的厨房
Uh, our kitchen was there before.

158
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:10,700
我刚才说的不够清楚吗
Am I being unclear?

159
00:05:11,300 --> 00:05:13,660
莱昂内尔 你好时髦啊
Okay, well, Lionel, don't you look sharp?

160
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:16,700
是伦敦哈罗德买的巴宝莉 对吧
It's Burberry from Harrods in London. Right?

161
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,900
你这孩子太棒了
Ohh, you wonderful child.

162
00:05:18,900 --> 00:05:21,240
你很快就再也不需要那些名牌学习卡了
You won't need those flashcards much longer.

163
00:05:21,337 --> 00:05:23,100
给 莱昂内尔住这里用的
Here, for Lionel's stay --

164
00:05:23,100 --> 00:05:25,181
一些小零食 洗漱用品
some snacks, toiletries,

165
00:05:25,181 --> 00:05:28,154
还有一本设计杂志 你们俩也可以读读
a design magazine you two could also flip through.

166
00:05:28,154 --> 00:05:29,200
好了 莱昂内尔
Okay, so, Lionel, uh,

167
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:30,800
我们给你在小房间里铺好床了
we have you set up here in the den.

168
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:31,980
电视也在那里
That's where the TV is,

169
00:05:31,980 --> 00:05:35,000
小卡说我们家有订体育频道呢
and Cam tells me that we have a sports package.

170
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:35,798
没关系
That's okay.

171
00:05:35,798 --> 00:05:37,280
我得练习写草书了
I should practice my cursive.

172
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:39,600
胡娇说书法是一门失传的艺术
Pepper says penmanship is a lost art.

173
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,380
是的 就跟感谢信一样要失传了
Yes. As are thank-you notes,

174
00:05:41,380 --> 00:05:42,660
所以我们只能猜测
which is why we can only assume

175
00:05:42,660 --> 00:05:44,160
你们很喜欢我们送的周年礼物
you enjoyed our anniversary gift.

176
00:05:44,980 --> 00:05:47,160
总之 我们得去机场了
Anyway, we have to get to the airport.

177
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:49,758
再见怎么说呢 莱昂内尔
How do we say goodbye, Lionel?

178
00:05:49,758 --> 00:05:50,860
再会[法语]
Au revoir.

179
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:52,720
送我们去门口吧
Come walk us to the door.

180
00:05:52,860 --> 00:05:54,209
他们把他怎么了
What have they done to him?

181
00:05:54,209 --> 00:05:57,280
把他变成了小"黑胡娇"
Turned him into a little black Pepper.

182
00:05:57,820 --> 00:05:59,440
太气人了
It's so infuriating.

183
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:01,300
感觉她都没把你当个男人对待
She treats you like you're not even a man.

184
00:06:01,300 --> 00:06:02,220
你不生气吗
Doesn't that bother you?

185
00:06:02,780 --> 00:06:04,060
如果你讨好每个人
You know, if you please everyone,

186
00:06:04,060 --> 00:06:05,660
你就没有取得足够的进步
you're not making enough progress.

187
00:06:05,660 --> 00:06:06,572
雪莉·桑德伯格名言
Cheryl Sandberg.

188
00:06:06,572 --> 00:06:08,900
这是垃圾吗
Hey, is this garbage?

189
00:06:08,900 --> 00:06:10,300
我不知道 里面有什么
I don't know. What's in it?

190
00:06:10,552 --> 00:06:14,680
"激情情趣绘画工具"
Uh, "Passion Painting Erotic Art Kit"?

191
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,360
那是什么
What is that?

192
00:06:17,016 --> 00:06:18,606
-天啊 -天啊
- Oh, my God. - Oh, my God.

193
00:06:19,713 --> 00:06:20,714
太恶心了
Gross! Ugh! ?Uh.

194
00:06:21,900 --> 00:06:22,940
其实呢
You know what?

195
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:25,540
如果她想把你当个小孩来贬低
If she wants to belittle you like you're some child,

196
00:06:25,540 --> 00:06:26,940
我们就用这个
we are going to use this

197
00:06:26,940 --> 00:06:28,380
让她瞧瞧你有多男人
to show her what kind of man you are.

198
00:06:28,380 --> 00:06:30,580
我不想我的T恤和袜子沾上颜料啊
I don't want to get paint on my T-shirt and socks.

199
00:06:30,580 --> 00:06:32,300
那可能这次你得都脱掉了
Well, maybe you'll just have to take them off for this one.

200
00:06:35,420 --> 00:06:37,040
早上好 怎么样啊 兄弟
Morning! How's my guy?

201
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:39,582
糟透了 我昨晚做了无数噩梦
Awful. I had a zillion nightmares.

202
00:06:39,582 --> 00:06:41,480
我是和小短讲话 不过 你是挺惨啊
I was talking to Shorty, but gee, that's rough.

203
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:43,600
咱们一块去我的俱乐部吃早餐吧
Hey, let's have breakfast at my club today.

204
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:45,700
我们每周五会做一个"昨日土豆"
We do a thing on Friday called "Yesterday's Potatoes."

205
00:06:45,700 --> 00:06:47,278
他们把前一天晚的炸薯条
They take last night's French fries

206
00:06:47,278 --> 00:06:48,600
做成今天的家常土豆
and make 'em into today's home fries,

207
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,468
而前一晚的薯条超好吃啊
and last night's fries were fantastic.

208
00:06:50,468 --> 00:06:53,301
听起来不错 但歌洛莉亚已经做好了
Sounds delicious, but, uh, Gloria already cooked.

209
00:06:53,301 --> 00:06:55,160
俩荷包蛋 西班牙辣香肠
Two poached eggs, chorizo,

210
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:57,020
还有抹黑莓酱的牛角包
and a croissant with blackberry jam.

211
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:58,496
-赞啊 -曼尼最喜欢的早饭
- Yes! - ?Manny's favorite.

212
00:06:58,496 --> 00:07:00,060
天啊 你干嘛不直接给他打电话
Geez, why don't you just call him?

213
00:07:00,060 --> 00:07:01,210
顺着习惯就做了的
I made it out of habit.

214
00:07:01,295 --> 00:07:04,701
但幸好 小短喜欢
But thankfully, Shorty loved it.

215
00:07:04,701 --> 00:07:06,440
是吧 小乖乖
Didn't you, Papi?

216
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:06,900
好吧 听我说
Okay, I'll tell you what.

217
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,080
你干嘛不换下那睡衣
Why don't you get out of those pajamas...

218
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:08,626
什么睡衣
What pajamas?

219
00:07:08,626 --> 00:07:10,625
来坐 那不是睡衣吗
come sit while I -- Those aren't pajamas?

220
00:07:10,625 --> 00:07:13,160
不是 其实呢 歌洛莉亚和我送乔上学后
No. Actually, Gloria and I are gonna go to the farmer's market

221
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:15,393
-打算去农贸市场 -为什么
- after we drop Joe off at school. - ?Why?

222
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,680
算是跟我工作有关吧
It's kind of work-related.

223
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:19,900
你的朋友有着成功的果汁生意呢
Your friend has a very successful juice business

224
00:07:19,900 --> 00:07:21,220
在哥斯达黎加
in Costa Rica.

225
00:07:21,220 --> 00:07:22,980
他们称我水果之王[骚基之王]
They call me the Fruit King.

226
00:07:22,980 --> 00:07:25,040
他们肯定是看到你的衣服了 听我说
They must have seen the outfit. I'll tell you what.

227
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,860
我今天早上办公室还有点事
I got a little thing this morning at the office.

228
00:07:26,860 --> 00:07:28,248
我们1:00在这儿见
Why don't we meet back here at 1:00

229
00:07:28,248 --> 00:07:29,980
咱俩好朋友好好聊聊 好吗
for a little best-friend catch-up? Deal?

230
00:07:29,980 --> 00:07:31,180
好的 听起来不错
Deal. Sounds good.

231
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:32,300
知道什么听起来不怎么样吗
You know what doesn't sound good?

232
00:07:32,300 --> 00:07:35,460
一个爷们叫另一个爷们为最好的朋友
One grown man calling another grown man his best friend.

233
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:37,060
她不懂我们 回见 老兄
She doesn't get us. See you, buddy.

234
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:39,720
那是什么
What is that?

235
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:41,560
白面包加毛豆泥
Crostini with edamame puree.

236
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:44,280
胡娇说还在吃西红柿罗勒的人
Pepper says anyone who's still doing tomato-basil

237
00:07:44,309 --> 00:07:46,320
错过了流行[船] 或者说活该错过
missed the boat, or should have.

238
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:47,660
莱昂内尔 你不一定要吃
Hey, Lionel, you don't have to eat

239
00:07:47,660 --> 00:07:48,921
他们给你带来的东西
that stuff they brought for you.

240
00:07:48,921 --> 00:07:49,963
我们不会告密的
We -- we won't tell.

241
00:07:49,963 --> 00:07:51,340
来个奇多 尽情做个小孩
Ch-- Pop a Cheeto. Be a kid.

242
00:07:51,340 --> 00:07:52,720
但他俩费心
But the guys went to the trouble

243
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:54,080
让罗莎给我做了这个
of making Rosa make this for me.

244
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:55,620
我应该吃完它
I should finish it.

245
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:57,120
莱昂内尔 当心 接着
Hey, Lionel, heads up. Catch.

246
00:07:57,140 --> 00:07:58,278
不了 谢谢
No, thank you.

247
00:07:58,278 --> 00:08:00,632
胡娇和罗纳多不让在家里玩球
Pepper and Ronaldo don't allow ball play in the house.

248
00:08:00,632 --> 00:08:03,380
你不在胡娇和罗纳多家里
Well, you aren't at Pepper and Ronaldo's house.

249
00:08:03,380 --> 00:08:05,320
这里是好玩之家
This is a fun house.

250
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:07,040
是啊 他们也这么叫
Yeah, that's what they call it.

251
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,600
现在我真的想扔东西了
Well, now I feel like throwing something,

252
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:10,240
莱昂内尔 注意啦 接着
so, hey, Lionel, heads up. Catch.

253
00:08:13,736 --> 00:08:14,680
对不起
Uh, I'm sorry.

254
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:17,000
我和胡娇说了 穿这外套我胳膊动不了
I told Pepper I couldn't move my arms in this jacket,

255
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,560
但他说 "修身胜过合身"
but he said, "Fit over function."

256
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,820
不 没事 没事
No, you know what? I-It's fine. It's fine.

257
00:08:19,820 --> 00:08:21,260
-东西碎了没什么 -我来赔
- Things break. - I'll pay for it.

258
00:08:21,260 --> 00:08:22,740
不 你不用 那是我们在加油站
No, you won't. We got it for free

259
00:08:22,740 --> 00:08:24,580
开信用卡时免费送的
when we opened a credit card at the gas station.

260
00:08:24,580 --> 00:08:27,278
我坚持赔 我包里有旅行支票
I insist. I have traveler's checks in my bag.

261
00:08:27,278 --> 00:08:28,967
不 莱昂内尔 没事的
No, Lionel, it's f-- okay.

262
00:08:28,967 --> 00:08:30,420
不 这让我很难受
No, you know what, this is upsetting me.

263
00:08:30,420 --> 00:08:31,800
他穿着也受他们控制
He dresses the way they tell him to dress.

264
00:08:31,900 --> 00:08:33,339
饮食也受他们控制
He eats what they tell him to eat.

265
00:08:33,339 --> 00:08:34,840
是啊 他们控制了他的一言一行
I know. They control his every move,

266
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:37,380
也很明显能看出他为了配合压力很大
and he clearly feels pressured to go along with it.

267
00:08:37,380 --> 00:08:38,820
或许这就是为什么他一直对我说
That's probably why he keeps telling me

268
00:08:38,820 --> 00:08:40,378
我能住在这很幸运
how lucky I am to live here.

269
00:08:40,378 --> 00:08:43,000
他说了这种话吗 你怎么不告诉我们
He said that? Wh-Why didn't you tell us?

270
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,840
你们俩说话时不太给别人插话的余...
You guys don't leave a lot of space to jump into your conversat-

271
00:08:45,340 --> 00:08:46,120
你知道这是怎么回事吗 小卡
You know what this is, Cam?

272
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:48,020
他明显很嫉妒莉莉
He's obviously jealous of Lily

273
00:08:48,020 --> 00:08:50,380
因为我们允许她做个孩子 能尽情玩耍
because we allow her to be a kid and have fun.

274
00:08:50,380 --> 00:08:51,520
如果他知道我能去学骑马
Imagine how jealous he'll be

275
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:54,180
想象一下他该有多嫉妒啊
when he finds out about my horseback-riding lessons.

276
00:08:54,244 --> 00:08:55,511
-放弃吧 -想得美
- Let it go. - We're not doing that.

277
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:58,880
你知道我现在想吃什么吗
You know what I'm in the mood for?

278
00:08:58,880 --> 00:09:00,780
我知道听起来很神经 但我想吃华夫饼
And I know it sounds crazy, but waffles.

279
00:09:00,780 --> 00:09:01,900
什么鬼
What the hell?

280
00:09:01,900 --> 00:09:04,220
你说得对 你总能阻止我浪过头
You're right. You keep me from flying too high.

281
00:09:04,220 --> 00:09:06,640
"提前祝你生日快乐 妈妈
"Happy early birthday, Mom.

282
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:09,260
爱你的艾丽克斯和本" 我的天啊
Love, Alex and Ben." Oh, my God.

283
00:09:09,260 --> 00:09:11,120
对啊 还有六个月才到你生日呢
I know. Your birthday isn't for six months.

284
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,580
不 菲尔
No, Phil!

285
00:09:16,026 --> 00:09:18,260
二位好 这画挺酷的 谁画的
Hey, guys. Cool painting. Who did it?

286
00:09:18,260 --> 00:09:19,460
艾丽克斯和本
?Alex and Ben.

287
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:21,680
我昨晚好像听到他们作画了
Oh, I think I heard them making it last night.

288
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:23,940
她一直说他"做"得不对 但我看挺好的
She kept saying he was doing it wrong, but it looks good to me.

289
00:09:24,460 --> 00:09:26,320
虽然我对艺术毫无了解
I mean, I don't know anything about art,

290
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:28,600
但 我了解自己喜欢什么
but... I know what I like.

291
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:32,180
我不过调侃一句本是妈宝
I make one comment about Ben's mommy,

292
00:09:32,180 --> 00:09:33,660
艾丽克斯就来这一出
and Alex does this.

293
00:09:33,660 --> 00:09:35,060
她太好斗了
It's aggressive.

294
00:09:35,060 --> 00:09:37,200
感觉她用掌印画火鸡才多久之前
I remember when she made a turkey with her handprint.

295
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,300
她只是想气我
She's just trying to get

296
00:09:39,300 --> 00:09:41,100
看我什么反应 对不对
some sort of reaction out of me, isn't she?

297
00:09:41,380 --> 00:09:42,740
但你不会上钩的 对吧
But you're not gonna take the bait, right?

298
00:09:42,740 --> 00:09:44,320
-你没那么小气 -我可说不好 菲尔
- You're bigger than that. ?- I don't know, Phil.

299
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:46,500
她这可是对我们大不敬
This is-This is very disrespectful.

300
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:48,460
我觉得我们得挫挫她的锐气
I think she needs to be taken down a peg.

301
00:09:48,460 --> 00:09:50,400
你打算坐下和她好好聊聊 对吧
So then, you'll just sit her down and talk to her, right?

302
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:52,360
那也行
I could do that,

303
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:56,080
或许在她和本过来一起吃晚餐时说
maybe over dinner with her and Ben...

304
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,700
这就对了 我为你骄傲
There you go. I'm proud of you.

305
00:09:57,700 --> 00:10:00,140
一顿令人难忘的晚餐
...A dinner no one will soon forget.

306
00:10:00,140 --> 00:10:01,060
好吧
Fine.

307
00:10:01,060 --> 00:10:03,220
但我告诉你 我要去吃华夫饼了
But know that I'm having a waffle.

308
00:10:03,380 --> 00:10:05,420
瞧瞧你对我们家做了些什么
This is what you're doing to our family!

309
00:10:08,540 --> 00:10:10,820
停车 你知道规矩 戴好头盔
Stop. You know the rules. Helmet.

310
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:16,220
继续开吧
Off with you.

311
00:10:17,190 --> 00:10:18,424
小短 你在说笑
Shorty, you're kidding.

312
00:10:18,424 --> 00:10:19,920
我从不拿水果的事说笑
I never joke when it comes to fruit.

313
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:22,960
你手里的奇迹之果是李子和杏杂交的
That miracle in your hand is a half plum, half apricot.

314
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:25,400
想当初只有一起打成果汁才能让二者结合
There was a time they could only accomplish that in juice.

315
00:10:25,770 --> 00:10:26,790
杰
Oh. ?Jay.

316
00:10:27,106 --> 00:10:30,440
不好意思 我一高兴忘记时间了
Oh, sorry, I kind of lost track of time.

317
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,280
别在意
Hey, no worries.

318
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:34,040
我不过是你四年没见的最好的朋友
Who among us hasn't blown off his best friend

319
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:36,702
你为了买水果放我鸽子也是人之常情
he hasn't seen in four years to go fruit shopping?

320
00:10:36,702 --> 00:10:40,120
感觉某人该来杯石榴葡萄大爆炸降降火
Sounds like somebody could use a Pomegrapefruit Blast.

321
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:42,400
"大爆炸"就是"酸奶"
Blast means "yogurt."

322
00:10:42,420 --> 00:10:44,460
你在丛林里住得太久了
You've been spending too much time in the jungle.

323
00:10:44,460 --> 00:10:46,180
你需要重新体验一下文明
What you need is a little civilization.

324
00:10:46,300 --> 00:10:47,665
我们去打保龄球吧
Let's go bowling.

325
00:10:47,665 --> 00:10:48,803
我很想去 不过...
Well, I would love to, but, uh...

326
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:52,560
我想在去剧院前睡一会儿
I kind of want to take a nap before we got to the theater.

327
00:10:53,414 --> 00:10:55,617
-你要带小短去剧院吗 -是的
- Um, you're taking Shorty to the theater? - Ah, yes.

328
00:10:55,617 --> 00:10:57,380
我买票本是想和曼尼一起去
I got the tickets for me and Manny,

329
00:10:57,380 --> 00:10:58,619
但他不能去
but he can't go

330
00:10:58,619 --> 00:11:01,140
小短又很喜欢《魔法坏女巫》
and Shorty loves "Wicked."

331
00:11:01,140 --> 00:11:02,317
他觉得他像好女巫格琳达
He thinks he's a Galinda

332
00:11:02,317 --> 00:11:04,280
他哥像坏女巫爱尔法巴
and his brother an Elphaba.

333
00:11:04,280 --> 00:11:05,420
你意识到自己在做什么了吗
You know what you're doing, don't you?

334
00:11:05,640 --> 00:11:06,900
你在把小短变成曼尼
You're turning Shorty into Manny.

335
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:08,560
别再霸占我最好的朋友了
Stop hogging my best friend!

336
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:11,179
好吧 如果你不爽 那你带他去
Okay, if you're so upset, then you can take him.

337
00:11:11,179 --> 00:11:13,160
但别再说"最好的朋友"了
But stop saying "best friend."

338
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:14,820
你这个年纪不该用那个词了
You're too old to be using that word.

339
00:11:14,820 --> 00:11:16,800
蒙大拿的汉娜可以有最好的朋友
Hannah from Montana has a best friend.

340
00:11:17,100 --> 00:11:17,639
而你不可以
You don't.

341
00:11:17,639 --> 00:11:19,454
至少我最好的朋友不是我儿子
At least my best friend isn't my son.

342
00:11:21,388 --> 00:11:23,023
我是你最好的朋友吗 妈妈
I'm your best friend, Mom?

343
00:11:23,023 --> 00:11:24,200
是的 小乖乖
Yes, Papi.

344
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:26,640
你就是他刚才说的那个儿子
You are the son that he's talking about.

345
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:31,441
如果他说莉莉能在我们家很幸运
Look, if he said Lily's lucky to be here,

346
00:11:31,441 --> 00:11:33,644
那他显然在胡娇和罗纳多家过得不开心
then he's clearly unhappy at Pepper and Ronaldo's.

347
00:11:33,644 --> 00:11:35,220
哪个孩子会开心啊
I mean, w-what kid wouldn't be?

348
00:11:35,220 --> 00:11:37,360
他们家得维持那么一尘不染
I mean, that house is so sterile.

349
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:39,320
