Or the first time we went away with your family

526
00:17:45,262 --> 00:17:47,001
去小木屋度假时 你故意各种呻吟
to that cabin and you made all those noises.

527
00:17:47,246 --> 00:17:48,360
我呻吟不是为了气他
Th-That wasn't about that.

528
00:17:48,360 --> 00:17:50,380
那如今这些呻吟都到哪儿去了 克莱尔
Then where did those noises go, Claire?

529
00:17:50,820 --> 00:17:53,240
我不会束手旁观看着你手撕本
I will not stand here while you tear poor Ben down

530
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,480
就像你爸当年也手撕了我一样
the way that Jay tore me down,

531
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:55,560
还有 本 你是蓝色还是金色
and, Ben, were you blue or gold?

532
00:17:55,660 --> 00:17:57,500
-我必须得知道 -我是蓝色
- I need to know. - I was blue.

533
00:17:57,500 --> 00:17:59,000
我想要来点《阿凡达》的感觉
I wanted to feel like an Avatar.

534
00:18:01,020 --> 00:18:02,160
本 是我不对
Ben, I'm sorry.

535
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:03,680
菲尔跟艾丽克斯说得对
Phil and Alex are right.

536
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:06,001
你不应该被如此对待
You don't deserve to be treated this way.

537
00:18:06,001 --> 00:18:07,320
谢谢 克莱尔 其实我...
Thank you, Claire. You know, I --

538
00:18:07,320 --> 00:18:09,360
我还没说完 我对你做的事
Not finished. I am doing to you...

539
00:18:09,360 --> 00:18:11,940
就是当年我爸对我与菲尔做的事
...exactly what my father did to me and Phil.

540
00:18:12,560 --> 00:18:14,280
他觉得任何人都配不上他的宝贝女儿...
No one was good enough for his little girl, and...

541
00:18:15,380 --> 00:18:17,620
我想我也觉得没人配得上我的宝贝女儿
And I suppose nobody's good enough for mine.

542
00:18:17,879 --> 00:18:21,860
但亲爱的 我也曾站在你这立场
But, honey, I've been where you are right now,

543
00:18:21,860 --> 00:18:23,740
所以我是最不应该
and I'm the last person

544
00:18:23,740 --> 00:18:25,580
给你增添无数磨难的人
who should be making it harder for you.

545
00:18:25,780 --> 00:18:27,560
我真的很对不起
I'm...I'm so sorry.

546
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:30,380
我不该故意留下性爱画作给你们看
And I'm sorry I left the sex painting for you to find.

547
00:18:30,380 --> 00:18:32,060
不知道你听完会不会开心点
If it makes you feel any better,

548
00:18:32,060 --> 00:18:33,360
其实画是假的
we faked it.

549
00:18:33,360 --> 00:18:35,020
本吓死了 根本无法"表现"
Ben was so freaked out, he couldn't perform.

550
00:18:35,760 --> 00:18:37,440
我听了一点都没开心啊
Doesn't make me feel any better.

551
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:39,120
但我开心多了
That helps a lot.

552
00:18:39,786 --> 00:18:45,583
? 我相信自己已变得比以前更好 ?
? I do believe I have been changed for the better ?

553
00:18:46,020 --> 00:18:48,160
我还是没懂为什么她是绿色的
I still don't understand why she's green.

554
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:50,985
? 因为我认识了你 ?
? Because I knew you ?

555
00:18:51,773 --> 00:18:55,808
? 因为我认识了你 ?
? Because I knew you ?

556
00:18:56,517 --> 00:19:01,261
? 因为我认识了你 ?
? Because I knew you ?

557
00:19:01,261 --> 00:19:09,421
? 让我永远地... ?
? I have been changed ?

558
00:19:09,421 --> 00:19:10,819
她们以前曾关系那么好
They used to be so close.

559
00:19:10,819 --> 00:19:12,620
-你还好吧 -? 改变了自己 ?
- You okay? - ? For good ?

560
00:19:12,620 --> 00:19:15,879
-她们怎么变成这样了 -我不知道啊
- What happened to them? - I don't know.

561
00:19:15,879 --> 00:19:17,545
我中间睡着了几分钟
I-I dozed off for a couple of minutes.

562
00:19:17,545 --> 00:19:19,951
不好意思 借过一下
Excuse me. Excuse me.

563
00:19:19,951 --> 00:19:21,360
对不起 不好意思
I'm sorry. Excuse me.

564
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:22,480
靠
Damn it.

565
00:19:22,916 --> 00:19:24,237
早知道就该让歌洛莉亚来
I should've sent Gloria.

566
00:19:28,980 --> 00:19:30,100
兄弟
Hey, fella.

567
00:19:30,100 --> 00:19:33,100
你这是怎么了
What happened in there?

568
00:19:33,360 --> 00:19:34,240
杰 我是个骗子
I'm a fraud, Jay.

569
00:19:35,080 --> 00:19:36,240
我就是个大骗子
I'm a damn fraud.

570
00:19:36,420 --> 00:19:38,679
别这样啦 人人都有怪异的哭点
Come on. We all cry at weird stuff.

571
00:19:38,679 --> 00:19:41,040
像我是拳击手打完之后拥抱的那一刻
For me, it's when boxers hug after a fight.

572
00:19:41,040 --> 00:19:43,060
我的重点不是哭
It's not the crying I'm worried about.

573
00:19:43,060 --> 00:19:44,060
其实你说得没错
You were right.

574
00:19:44,060 --> 00:19:46,800
你说过我要是去哥斯达黎加 就会倾家荡产
You said I would lose everything if I went to Costa Rica,

575
00:19:46,800 --> 00:19:47,480
你说对了
and I did.

576
00:19:47,480 --> 00:19:48,349
你在说什么鬼
What are you talking about?

577
00:19:48,349 --> 00:19:50,060
你不是什么果汁业大亨吗
I-I-I thought you were a big juice magnate.

578
00:19:50,060 --> 00:19:52,258
谎话 都是谎话
Lies! It's all lies, Jay!

579
00:19:52,258 --> 00:19:53,900
我才不是什么果汁大亨
I'm not no juice magnate.

580
00:19:53,900 --> 00:19:55,820
我开了个果汁小摊 本来一切顺利
I had a juice stand, and things were okay --

581
00:19:56,277 --> 00:19:58,626
直到后来猴子拿到了我的刀...
until these monkeys got a hold of my knives.

582
00:19:59,333 --> 00:20:01,422
律师说我不能谈这件事
The lawyer says I can't talk about it.

583
00:20:02,160 --> 00:20:05,840
达琳也跟高空滑索的老板好上
Then Darlene takes off with this honcho in zip lines

584
00:20:05,840 --> 00:20:06,940
然后离我而去
and leaves me.

585
00:20:06,940 --> 00:20:08,740
所以我才一直躲着你
That's why I've been avoiding you.

586
00:20:08,740 --> 00:20:10,300
我就是个丢人现眼的废物
I'm a disgusting loser!

587
00:20:10,340 --> 00:20:11,640
你把我当什么人了
Who are you talking to?

588
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:13,120
在我面前你怕什么丢人
You don't need to be embarrassed.

589
00:20:13,280 --> 00:20:15,640
但你说过"你到时候出事了
But you said, "Don't come crying to me

590
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:18,160
可别来找我哭 我还得收拾烂摊子"
when it all turns to hell and I have to pick up the pieces."

591
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:20,280
-你说的 -也就是说说而已嘛
- You said that! - ?It's just what you say.

592
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:22,160
我当然会帮忙你收拾残局啊
Of course I'm gonna pick up the pieces.

593
00:20:22,160 --> 00:20:23,240
不然我还能怎么样
What else would I do?

594
00:20:23,360 --> 00:20:24,461
你是我最好的朋友啊
You're my best friend.

595
00:20:24,461 --> 00:20:27,817
妈的 你也是我最好的朋友啊 要抱抱
And you're my best friend, damn it. Come on.

596
00:20:28,725 --> 00:20:31,105
因为认识你 我变得更好了
I'm better because I knew you.

597
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:33,000
一辈子当最好的好朋友
Best friends forever.

598
00:20:34,497 --> 00:20:37,837
歌洛莉亚说得对 我现在懂了
Yeah, Gloria's right. I...I hear it now.

599
00:20:41,306 --> 00:20:42,793
曼尼开门嘛
Manny open the door.

600
00:20:42,793 --> 00:20:44,053
我知道你在房里
I know you are in there.

601
00:20:44,053 --> 00:20:45,820
妈 你来做什么
Mom, what are you doing here.

602
00:20:45,820 --> 00:20:48,041
我知道你说过你想有自己的空间
I know that you said that you want your space,

603
00:20:48,041 --> 00:20:50,737
但对我来说真的很难熬
but it's so hard on me, ok?

604
00:20:50,834 --> 00:20:54,305
所以我要你每天睡前给我发一封短信
So, I want a text message at the end of everyday,

605
00:20:54,305 --> 00:20:55,760
跟我报平安
telling me you are ok.

606
00:20:55,760 --> 00:20:57,260
然后每周三次
And three times a week,

607
00:20:57,260 --> 00:20:58,660
发你的自拍给我
a picture of your face

608
00:20:58,660 --> 00:20:59,880
这样我才能看着你的眼睛
so I can look into your eyes

609
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:01,240
知道你有没有说谎骗我
and see if you are lying to me.

610
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:02,880
妈 我们昨天早上才互通过短信
Mother, we texted yesterday morning.

611
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:04,760
才没有呢 上次都多久之前了
No, we didn't. That was days ago.

612
00:21:04,760 --> 00:21:06,600
昨天早上8点37分
Yesterday at 8:37A.M.

613
00:21:06,600 --> 00:21:08,420
你问我收到你寄的爱心包裹了没
You asked if I got your care package,

614
00:21:08,420 --> 00:21:10,440
还让我别告诉杰你给我寄了香肠
and said don't tell Jay I gave you a sausage.

615
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:12,240
然后你不小心发了语音消息
Then you accidentally hit voice memo,

616
00:21:12,240 --> 00:21:14,280
我听到你叫斯黛拉找块地去死
and I heard you tell Stella to go in a yard and die.

617
00:21:16,620 --> 00:21:18,860
对不起嘛 我好想你
Sorry. I just miss you.

618
00:21:24,400 --> 00:21:27,760
你偶尔来看看我应该也没关系啦
I guess it's not so terrible of you stopping by every now and then.
